; -- The village --------------------------------------------------------------
; A 36 m square of town wall with two gates, east towards the road to the Vale and north towards
; the woods. Eight houses line the walls; the plaza, the shrine and the villagers keep the middle
; (filled out 2026-10-09: market, smithy, armourer and a training yard).

